        <briefdescription>
<para>Write the resolver code into the given memory. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The user is responsible for allocating the memory and setting permissions.</para>
<para>ReentryFnAddr should be the address of a function whose signature matches void* (*)(void *TrampolineAddr, void *ReentryCtxAddr). The ReentryCtxAddr argument of writeResolverCode will be passed as the second argument to the function at ReentryFnAddr. </para>
